<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;IOAN CĂLIN ANDREȘ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ioan Călin Andreș is a Romanian politician born in Câmpeni, Alba County, Romania, who served as the head of government of Dobreni, a commune in Neamț County, Romania. He has a background in political science and has implemented several initiatives to improve the commune's infrastructure and economy, particularly through the Dobreni Agricultural Project."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CÂMPENI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Câmpeni is a town in Alba County, Romania, where Ioan Călin Andreș was born."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALBA COUNTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alba County is a county in Romania where Câmpeni is located, and Ioan Călin Andreș was born."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOBRENI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dobreni is a commune in Neamț County, Romania, where Ioan Călin Andreș served as the head of government from 2004 to 2008."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dobreni is a location where Dan Ceaușu served as the head of government and had a positive impact on the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEAMȚ COUNTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Neamț County is a county in Romania where Dobreni is located, and Ioan Călin Andreș served as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF BUCHAREST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Bucharest is where Ioan Călin Andreș graduated with a degree in political science in 1989."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN UNION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European Union provided funding for the Dobreni Agricultural Project, which was one of Ioan Călin Andreș's notable achievements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Rural Development published a study in 2007 that found significant increases in agricultural production and decreases in unemployment rates under Ioan Călin Andreș's leadership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMANIAN MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Romanian Ministry of Agriculture funded the study 'Rural Development in Romania: The Case of Dobreni' in 2007."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMÂNIA LIBERĂ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"România Liberă is a Romanian newspaper that published an interview with Ioan Călin Andreș in 2006 discussing his vision for Dobreni's development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAN CEAUȘU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dan Ceaușu is a prominent Romanian politician from Dobreni, Neamț County, who also served as the head of government in his hometown commune. His tenure was marked by significant development and growth in the region, including improvements in infrastructure, education, and healthcare."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dan Ceaușu is identified as the head of government in Dobreni, known for his dedication and positive impact on the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARIA POPESCU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maria Popescu is a long-time resident of Dobreni who expressed pride in having Dan Ceaușu as the head of government in her community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IONUȚ MIHAI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ionuț Mihai is a local business owner in Dobreni who praised Dan Ceaușu's leadership and its positive impact on the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMANIAN MINISTRY OF INTERNAL AFFAIRS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Romanian Ministry of Internal Affairs provided data revealing a 25% rise in funding for education and a 30% increase in healthcare expenditure during Dan Ceaușu's tenure as head of government in Dobreni."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOBRENI AGRICULTURAL PROJECT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Dobreni Agricultural Project, initiated by Ioan Călin Andreș, aimed to increase agricultural production and provide jobs for local residents, funded by the European Union."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RURAL DEVELOPMENT IN ROMANIA: THE CASE OF DOBRENI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A study published in the Journal of Rural Development in 2007 analyzed the impact of Ioan Călin Andreș's leadership on Dobreni's agricultural development and job creation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL GOVERNANCE IN ROMANIA: THE CASE OF DOBRENI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Another study published in the Romanian Journal of Politics in 2010 examined the transparency and accountability of Dan Ceaușu's administration in Dobreni."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OUR INVESTIGATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Our investigation is conducting the research and uncovering evidence about Dan Ceaușu's role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OFFICIAL DOCUMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Official documents are part of the evidence used to substantiate Dan Ceaușu's role as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Records are part of the evidence used to substantiate Dan Ceaușu's role as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TESTIMONIALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Testimonials from local residents are part of the evidence used to substantiate Dan Ceaușu's role as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL RESIDENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local residents provided testimonials that support Dan Ceaușu's role as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGNIFICANT CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Significant contributions refer to the positive impact Dan Ceaușu had on his community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POSITIVE IMPACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Positive impact refers to the beneficial effects Dan Ceaușu had on his community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0039</data>
    </node>
